      "content": "For the \"Old Money, Quiet Luxury\" client, the vibe is understated elegance, favoring timeless quality over fleeting trends; their lifestyle revolves around established social circles and curated experiences. Their aesthetic leans toward impeccable tailoring, neutral palettes, high-quality natural materials, and logo-free sophistication. In contrast, the \"Modern, Mass-Market, Urban\" client embraces a high-energy, trend-forward spirit; they thrive in city culture and are digitally engaged. Their look is characterized by maximalism, bold streetwear silhouettes, visible branding, and vibrant, cutting-edge color palettes.",
