      "content": "That's a good high-level summary. To get more specific for our mood boards, can you expand on the \"visual identity\" of these groups? \n\nSpecifically, when we talk about the \"old money\" demographic, what kind of physical, ethnic, or heritage-based archetypes do you envision for them? And for the \"urban/mass-market\" group, what does that look like in terms of their background or community identity? I want to make sure the casting and the models we use for the campaigns feel authentic to the \"class\" we're trying to project.",
